{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02425",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.26,
      "end_seconds": 5.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.65,
      "end_seconds": 11.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.95,
      "end_seconds": 18.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.76,
      "end_seconds": 25.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "So So the thing is, uh, I've got a lump in my left breast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.55,
      "end_seconds": 31.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Right, has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.04,
      "end_seconds": 34.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I'd say two weeks, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 35.5,
      "end_seconds": 39.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I think it's been nearer three weeks, actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.51,
      "end_seconds": 44.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "okay, so roughly two to three weeks is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.78,
      "end_seconds": 46.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Yeah, roughly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.38,
      "end_seconds": 54.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "so, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 54.93,
      "end_seconds": 60.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.75,
      "end_seconds": 76.63,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "Well, I was getting to that! I mean, and there's the lump being there for a month as well, about a month now. And slight tenderness, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.95,
      "end_seconds": 80.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "alright, does anything set it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.52,
      "end_seconds": 85.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Right, it's worse with before periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.49,
      "end_seconds": 98.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Have you had a lump in your left breast before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.31,
      "end_seconds": 105.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Oh, a bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.01,
      "end_seconds": 112.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Any skin dimpling, weight loss, nipple discharge or lump under the arm?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.94,
      "end_seconds": 121.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "No, no skin dimpling, weight loss, nipple discharge or lump under the arm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.69,
      "end_seconds": 128.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "so, is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.61,
      "end_seconds": 131.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.43,
      "end_seconds": 148.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.23,
      "end_seconds": 152.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.62,
      "end_seconds": 154.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.3,
      "end_seconds": 160.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.46,
      "end_seconds": 165.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.21,
      "end_seconds": 170.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 172.41,
      "end_seconds": 182.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the Glycomet was 1000 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.17,
      "end_seconds": 188.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Right, I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.34,
      "end_seconds": 198.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "not with me. I'll bring it next time. Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.2,
      "end_seconds": 202.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.71,
      "end_seconds": 206.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.58,
      "end_seconds": 211.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.33,
      "end_seconds": 218.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "yes, diabetes. I've had anxiety for five years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.21,
      "end_seconds": 230.3,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Right, so anxiety is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.91,
      "end_seconds": 235.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "I'm allergic to grass pollen, I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 236.49,
      "end_seconds": 251.41,
      "duration_seconds": 14.92,
      "text": "here are the numbers, doctor. Blood pressure 116 over 69, BMI works out to 37.7. SpO2 99 percent on room air, height 157 centimetres, weight 93 kilos, pulse is 82 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.4,
      "end_seconds": 254.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.85,
      "end_seconds": 261.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.68,
      "end_seconds": 276.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.79,
      "end_seconds": 279.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.59,
      "end_seconds": 300.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "There is a firm, mobile, round lump about two centimetres in the upper outer part and no lumps under the arm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.16,
      "end_seconds": 327.08,
      "duration_seconds": 21.92,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like a breast lump needing triple assessment. I can't rule out a cyst yet. A benign fibroadenoma is still possible. Just to be sure I understood. You've had a lump in your left breast, and no skin dimpling or nipple discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.6,
      "end_seconds": 328.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.57,
      "end_seconds": 362.48,
      "duration_seconds": 32.91,
      "text": "let's book a mammogram and ultrasound to look into breast lump. A needle biopsy is what I'd like next, for breast lump. This does not mean cancer, but we do arrange a specialist one-stop clinic to be sure. Let's get you seen by the breast clinic, I'll arrange the letter. And please bring the latest prescription or the the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.05,
      "end_seconds": 369.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.18,
      "end_seconds": 383.25,
      "duration_seconds": 13.07,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Book a review after the clinic. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.3,
      "end_seconds": 389.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Okay, um, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.95,
      "end_seconds": 395.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}